summary: Release goes to a farm, not the void. Visit and reclaim any Pokemon you've let go.
author: (you)
tags: [gameplay, qol, farm, release, storage]
differences:
  - Adds a real, walkable location: a small field connected to Pallet Town's east edge.
  - Adds a FARM screen (Start menu and/or PC), following the same pane pattern as box storage.
  - From your Party or a Box, a new SEND TO FARM action moves a Pokemon into the farm instead of releasing it into nothing.
  - From the FARM screen, any Pokemon can be reclaimed back to an open Party or Box slot.
  - Vanilla release is untouched — this is an additive alternative, not a replacement, so nothing breaks if the mod is later disabled.
credits:
  - Core loop concept and design: (you)
  - Built against the confirmed mod-API patterns (screens registry, ui hooks, save.boxes/save.party shape) demonstrated in MadeinTaly's gen3_box.
